            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The dispute centers on the interpretation of Section 633a, which requires federal personnel actions to be \"free from any discrimination based on age.\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Roman Martinez",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "88b8970ca43c81ac8d497c96b48d8b18d30a37738b8b497b545f778d95f26b6f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-88b8970ca43c-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Roman Martinez, both parties agree that the language mirrors Title VII\u2019s anti\u2011discrimination provision for race, sex, and religion."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
